            "content": "<p><strong>How many devices can I charge at once?</strong></p><p>The 330W Power Station has 10 ports—so you can charge up to 10 devices simultaneously.</p><p>That includes laptops, phones, tablets, smartwatches, earbuds, gaming consoles, and more.</p><p>One station replaces your entire charger drawer.</p><p></p><p><strong>What devices are compatible with this power station?</strong></p><p>The 330W Power Station works with virtually every USB-powered device, including:</p><p>• MacBook Pro & MacBook Air</p><p>• Windows laptops (Dell, HP, Lenovo, etc.)</p><p>• iPhone & Android phones</p><p>• iPad & Android tablets</p><p>• Nintendo Switch & Steam Deck</p><p>• Apple Watch & smartwatches</p><p>• AirPods & wireless earbuds</p><p>• Cameras, controllers, Kindles, and more</p><p>If it charges via USB-C or USB-A, it works here.</p><p></p><p><strong>Can this charge my MacBook or laptop at full speed?</strong></p><p>Yes. The 330W Power Station includes two 100W USB-C ports specifically designed for laptops.</p><p>Your MacBook Pro can charge from 0 to 50% in just 28 minutes—the same speed as Apple's own charger.</p><p>No throttling, no compromises.</p><p></p><p><strong>What is GaN technology and why does it matter?</strong></p><p>GaN (Gallium Nitride) is the same semiconductor technology used in electric vehicles and SpaceX rockets.</p><p>It delivers more power in a smaller size—while running 20% cooler than traditional silicon chargers.</p><p>That means less heat, longer lifespan, and more power in a compact design that fits in your palm.</p><p></p><p><strong>How does the warranty work?</strong></p><p>We're confident in our build quality—the 330W Power Station comes with a 2-year warranty.</p><p>If anything goes wrong due to defects in materials or workmanship, we'll replace it free of charge.</p><p>Intentional damage or misuse is not covered.</p><p></p><p><strong>Is it safe to use with all my devices?</strong></p><p>Absolutely. Each port features intelligent power management that detects your device and delivers the optimal charge.</p><p>Built-in 8-point protection guards against overcharging, overheating, short circuits, and power surges.</p><p>Your devices are always safe.</p><p></p><p><strong>What's the difference between the USB-C and USB-A ports?</strong></p><p>USB-C ports (6 total) support Power Delivery for fast charging—including two 100W ports for laptops and four 30W ports for phones and tablets.</p><p>USB-A ports (4 total) deliver 18W Quick Charge 3.0—perfect for older devices, controllers, and accessories.</p><p>Both work simultaneously at full speed.</p><p></p><p><strong>Does it work internationally?</strong></p><p>Yes. The 330W Power Station accepts 100-240V input—so it works anywhere in the world.</p><p>Just bring the appropriate plug adapter for your destination.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_WkxVG7": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tech Specs",
            "content": "<h3><strong>Power Output</strong></h3><p>- Total Output: 330W</p><p>- USB-C1: 100W (Power Delivery 3.0)</p><p>- USB-C2: 100W (Power Delivery 3.0)</p><p>- USB-C3-C6: 30W each (Power Delivery)</p><p>- USB-A1-A4: 18W each (Quick Charge 3.0)</p><p></p><h3><strong>Dimensions & Build</strong></h3><p>- Size: 104.5 × 77.5 × 40 mm (4.1\" × 3.1\" × 1.6\")</p><p>- Weight: 258g (9.1 oz)</p><p>- Materials: Premium matte black ABS housing</p><p>- Cooling: GaN³ technology runs 20% cooler than silicon</p><p></p><h3><strong>Compatibility</strong></h3><p>- MacBook Pro, MacBook Air, Windows laptops</p><p>- iPhone 15/14/13/12/SE, Samsung Galaxy, Google Pixel</p><p>- iPad Pro, iPad Air, Samsung Tab, Android tablets</p><p>- Nintendo Switch, Steam Deck, PS5/Xbox controllers</p><p>- Apple Watch, AirPods, Galaxy Buds, wireless earbuds</p><p>- Cameras, Kindles, power banks, and more</p><p>- Universal USB-C PD and USB-A QC3.0 support</p><p></p><h3><strong>Safety & Certifications</strong></h3><p>- 8-Point Protection System</p><p>- Over-current, over-voltage, over-temperature protection</p><p>- Short-circuit and surge protection</p><p>- Intelligent device detection</p><p>- Certifications: FCC, CE, RoHS</p><p>- Input: 100-240V AC (universal voltage)</p><p></p><h3><strong>Warranty</strong></h3><p>- 2-Year Warranty – full coverage for peace of mind</p>"
          }
        }
      },
