        "accordion_zBGHUq": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "FAQ",
            "content": "<h3>Is it more durable than standard cables?</h3><p><br/>Yes. Most cables fail after 10,000 bends. Titan Cable Pro is tested to survive over 300,000 thanks to reinforced military-grade fibers and a 90° anti-break Stress-Defender™ head.<br/><br/></p><h3>Does it work with all my devices?</h3><p><br/>Yes. It’s universally compatible with USB-C, Lightning, and Micro USB — covering iPhone, Android, laptops, tablets, Switch, GoPro, and more.<br/><br/></p><h3>Will it work with my case?</h3><p><br/>Yes. The low-profile 90° connector is designed to fit through most protective phone cases — even thick ones.<br/><br/></p><h3>How fast does it charge?</h3><p><br/>Up to 100W with a USB-C PD charger — enough to charge most phones in under 30 minutes or power a laptop at full speed. To unlock max speed, pair it with the Titan PD Plug above.<br/><br/></p><h3>Is it safe for battery health?</h3><p><br/>Yes. The built-in SmartChip regulates current to prevent overheating and battery degradation — protecting battery health long term.<br/><br/></p><h3>Can I use it for data transfer?</h3><p><br/>Yes. It supports USB 3.1 Gen 2 transfer — ideal for fast syncing of files, photos, music, and 4K video.<br/><br/></p><h3>Is it car compatible?</h3><p><br/>Yes. It works with all USB car chargers and supports both Apple CarPlay and Android Auto without interruption.<br/><br/></p><h3>Are the magnets safe?</h3><p><br/>Yes. AutoMag™ Wind-Up uses low-strength surface magnets that don’t interfere with your phone, battery, or payment cards.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_WkxVG7": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tech Specs",
            "content": "<h3>Warranty</h3><p><br/>- 2-Year Limited Warranty – full coverage for peace of mind, see terms</p><h3><br/><br/>30-Day Returns</h3><p><br/>- Freedom if you change your mind, see policy </p><h3></h3><h3></h3><h3>Materials</h3><p><br/>- Titan-reinforced core (body armor grade)<br/><br/>- Braided nylon jacket (anti-fray, anti-tear)<br/><br/>- 90° aluminum alloy connectors<br/><br/>-Magnetic self-winding design<br/><br/></p><h3>Performance</h3><p><br/>- 100W fast charging (USB-C PD)<br/><br/>- SmartChip™ for safe power delivery<br/><br/>- USB 3.1 data transfer (10 Gbps)<br/><br/>- 300,000+ bend lifespan (30x stronger than standard)<br/><br/>- Pair with the Titan PD Plug for fastest charge speeds<br/><br/></p><h3>Compatibility</h3><p><br/>- USB-C, Lightning devices<br/><br/>- iPhone (14, 13, 12, SE), iPad, iPad Pro, MacBook Air/Pro<br/><br/>- Samsung Galaxy (S24/S23/S22), Note series, Z Flip/Fold<br/><br/>- Google Pixel, OnePlus, Huawei, Xiaomi, Motorola, Sony<br/><br/>- Laptops (Windows & Chrome), GoPro, Nintendo Switch, eReaders<br/><br/>- Power banks, car chargers, wall adapters, and more<br/><br/>- Covers USB-C to USB-C, USB-A to USB-C & Lightning setups<br/><br/>- Universal compatibility across all major devices (Not limited to above)<br/><br/></p><p></p>"
          }
        },
